,{"id":1780244846740,"text":"明天早上我送你。","rawContent":"明天早上我送你。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1780247990882,"roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":30348},{"id":1780244846741,"text":"要是真不舒服，到了公司我再让远舟去接你回来。","rawContent":"要是真不舒服，到了公司我再让远舟去接你回来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1780247993652,"roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":30349},{"id":1780244846742,"sender":"them","text":"他低头，薄唇贴在她的耳廓上，声音低沉又温柔，带着一丝不易察觉的懊恼。","timestamp":1780247993656,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"他低头，薄唇贴在她的耳廓上，声音低沉又温柔，带着一丝不易察觉的懊恼。","roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":30350},{"id":1780244846743,"text":"现在好点没？","rawContent":"现在好点没？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1780247997730,"roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":30351},{"id":1780244846744,"text":"还噎得慌吗？","rawContent":"还噎得慌吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:19","timestamp":1780247999044,"roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","characterId":"d8a326fa-9988-447d-8d82-e4e5a4ece511","_id":30352},{"id":1780244846745,"text":"都是我不好，以后再也不惹你生气了。","rawContent":"都是我不好，以后再也不惹你生气了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"上午01:20","timestamp":1780248001995,"roundId":"round_1780247952033_qjyn2lgq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775571541656_v84y814wp","c